                        "commentary"
                    ],
                    "heading": "Commentary",
                    "text": [
                        "Most of my extra time this month was devoted to rebuilding this portfolio site from scratch and developing this log output system. I wish I had been able to spend more time developing this game but I have to balance my priorities. It always concerns me that I think others think that the game hasn't had any progress, so I made these logs. I hope they will help me find a job too. This system is also useful for web development progress tracking.",
                        "A lot of this month's time was wasted trying to improve the looping circuit behavior of Rollerbots which I ended up undoing when I realized it was more work than it was worth, plus the problem it intended to solve was not really a problem. Initially, I assumed it would involve a lot of interaction with setting spawn variables with the map editor, but in reality it's not bad at all. Finally, I updated GameMaker and had to fix the installation (it was Linux-related issues + the very-Beta version of GameMaker)."
                    ]
